              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.7.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isaya 7:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha, Resini mfalume wa Aramu na Peka mwana wa Remaliya mfalume wa Iziraeli akpwedzapiga viha Jerusalemu, nao amzunguluka Ahazi, ela taayaweza kumturya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati hinyo, Resini mfalume wa Aramu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Aramu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "tafusiri zanjina zinaamba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Edomu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " waauyizira Aaramu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tafusiri zanjina zinaamba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Aedomu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mudzi wa Elathi na achiazoresa atu a Juda. Nao Aedomu ainjira Elathi ambako anaishi hata rero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Ahazi wahuma atu kpwa mfalume Tigilathi-Pileseri wa Ashuru kpwendamuamba, “Mino ni mtumishio tsona mwanao. Ambuka wedze unitivye kula kpwa mfalume wa Aramu na wa Iziraeli, ambao ananishambuliya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi wahala feza na zahabu zokala ndani ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu na hazina yokala kpwenye nyumba ya mfalume na kumphirikira dza zawadi mfalume wa Ashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tigilathi-Pileseri, mfalume wa Ashuru wamphundza Ahazi, achendaushambuliya mudzi wa Damasikasi na kuuteka. Achimuolaga mfalume Resini na achiahala atu mateka hadi Kiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalume Ahazi ariphophiya Damasikasi kukutana na mfalume Tigilathi-Pileseri wa Ashuru, waona phatu pha kulavira sadaka hiko Damasikasi. Phahi, wamuhumira mlavyadzi-sadaka Uriya mfwano kamili na mchoro wa phatu hipho pha kulavira sadaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uriya wadzenga phatu pha kulavira sadaka kulengana na malagizo gosi ambago mfalume Ahazi walagiza kula Damasikasi, na achimala kuphadzenga kabila mfalume Ahazi kuuya kula Damasikasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi ariphouya kula Damasikasi, wakpwendaona hipho phatu pha kulavira sadaka, alafu mfalume waphasengerera pho phatu pha kulavira sadaka na achilavya sadaka dzuluze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walavya sadakaye ya kuochwa, ya mtsere, na ya chinwadzi, achitimvya-timvya milatso ya sadaka ya amani dzulu ya phatu pha kulavira sadaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.27.1+EXO.27.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 27:1–2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Nyakati 4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phatu pha kulavira sadaka pha shaba ambapho phatengbwa kpwa ajili ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, waphausa kula mbere za nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu, kula nafwasiye kahi-kahi ya phatuphe pha kulavira sadaka na nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, achiphaika uphande wa vurini mwa phatuphe pha kulavira sadaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona mfalume Ahazi wamlagiza mlavyadzi-sadaka Uriya achimuamba, “Humira hipha phatu phangu phakulu pha kulavira sadaka kpwa kuochera sadaka za ligundzu na sadaka za unga za dziloni, sadaka za kuochwa, sadaka za unga za mfalume na za atu osi na sadaka za chinwadzi chizorehwa ni atu. Unyunyize milatso ya nyama osi a kuocha ambao andalaviwa sadaka. Ela phara phatu pha kulavira sadaka pha shaba ndaphahumira mimi kpwa kuuzira mashauri kula kpwa Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye mlavyadzi-sadaka Uriya wahenda higa gosi, sawa na mfalume Ahazi arivyolagiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
