              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.2+2CH.4.3+2CH.4.4+2CH.4.5+2CH.4.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Nyakati 4:2–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalume Ahazi wakata vira viguzo vyoimisirwa birika, achiriusa kula dzulu ya hara ndzau kumi na airi a shaba na kuriika dzulu ya msingi wa mawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ukumbi uriohumirwa Siku ya kuoya uriodzengbwa ndani ya iyo nyumba, phamwenga na mryango wa kumenyera mfalume okala kondze, wavitsamiza kula kpwa yo nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, ili kumuhamira mfalume wa Ashuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
